# Game State Machine — Walkthrough

## What Was Built

A server-side game state machine for Trivi Time that synchronizes all clients (gameboard, player phones, host controller) via the status API. The host advances states with a "Next" button; the backend determines the next valid state automatically.

## State Flow

```
lobby → welcome → rules → get_ready → announced
                                         │
                         ┌───────────────┤
                         ▼               ▼
                 options_revealed  video_playing
                         │               │
                    [start-timer]    options_revealed
                         │               │
                   timer_running    [start-timer]
                         │
                    timer_ended (automatic)
                         │
                   answer_reveal
                         │
                    [next-question]
                         │
                     get_ready → ... (loop) or completed
```

