## New API Endpoints

| Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|----------|------|-------------|
| `POST /sessions/advance-state` | 🔒 | Advance the state machine by one step |
| `POST /sessions/start-timer` | 🔒 | Start the question timer (from [options_revealed](file:///d:/Career/freelance/trivi-time/tests/test_state_machine.py#154-171)) |
| `POST /sessions/set-break` | 🔒 | Trigger a break from any active state |

